"arch-finder", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "24a2f5e283699389c639f23a77ac1ce8f3511fb5", "message": "First update", "created_at": "2018-03-14T14:27:00Z", "repo": "arch-finder", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "eede966bc7d3d6a2da36c24b19553ab57b0bf2b5", "message": "Fix tab characters not being printed out", "created_at": "2016-03-16T15:33:03Z", "repo": "arch-finder", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9fdec061ee1337e2d3b6d7b35cb5b70e1d16a4f8", "message": "Condition on Yorubans only, not all Africans", "created_at": "2016-01-27T17:40:52Z", "repo": "arch-finder", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ba1f76b4a7a964cf68ab8b8a41b503b389be584a", "message": "Add a list of sample IDs of all 1000G individuals", "created_at": "2016-01-20T15:14:04Z", "repo": "arch-finder", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "593e40886032c8dc6650e9df2dbcdf44fff73bea", "message": "Fix not generating outputs with private Nea/Den sites", "created_at": "2016-01-20T11:55:07Z", "repo": "arch-finder", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a52ba594a2635867dd1c8dd99390c962025823de", "message": "Fix missing REF column in final BED files", "created_at": "2016-01-20T11:42:34Z", "repo": "arch-finder", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "022e855a81c4f2a7cc29d6b9c2db702e61a61eae", "message": "Create BED files with private Nea/Den positions\n\nThe only BED files created until now included even sites that are shared\nbetween Neanderthals and Denisovans.", "created_at": "2016-01-19T17:02:30Z", "repo": "arch-finder", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7d8cfa86f8ed1b509f49e87696bead0821a8741e", "message": "Put sample ID files to input/ and temporary BED to tmp/", "created_at": "2016-01-19T15:49:54Z", "repo": "arch-finder", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "25eb2c197ad2891a713cc6df5f866569c5688666", "message": "Leave the chromosome-specific VCFs as an output\n\nWe will no longer create Neanderthal/Denisovan-specific whole genome\nVCF files as an output since they are too big to load up at once in a\nmemory in later stages anyway (R at least has a big trouble doing that).\nWe will therefore create chromosome-specific output VCFs which will be\nthen subsetted during the analysis using Neanderthal or Denisovan\nspecific BED files.", "created_at": "2016-01-19T13:11:41Z", "repo": "arch-finder", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b7b391388007bed1d3a658b3430db55be3348ef3", "message": "Add column with REF allele to each final BED file", "created_at": "2016-01-18T09:46:38Z", "repo": "arch-finder", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "990f9a128523e397002b1c6b59e62a762639169b", "message": "Fix rules missing dependencies on tabix index files", "created_at": "2016-01-14T14:33:49Z", "repo": "arch-finder", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9022eeda52ceeafed0e18ba8e1595ccbd0d8c953", "message": "Fix make clean not removing output directories", "created_at": "2016-01-14T09:43:44Z", "repo": "arch-finder", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9fa683f9cd3a3a74663ecdcb2c79d4a4ffff2bf5", "message": "Create archaic frequency-specific output files", "created_at": "2016-01-14T09:13:37Z", "repo": "arch-finder", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9f20af98effe8cdf79176dbaccdcbeb05e00f30a", "message": "Don't create output directories before scanning started", "created_at": "2016-01-12T19:22:33Z", "repo": "arch-finder", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "20ab87a924e371038c5d09eb098affd10660d47c", "message": "Fix make clean not removing all output files", "created_at": "2016-01-12T19:05:53Z", "repo": "arch-finder", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "db21509a989586ee02b807fc9bba880d4c8227a0", "message": "Remove columns indicating presence of archaic-specific allele\n\nWe are interested only in the bases anyway and the previous format was\njust making downstream analysis code a bit more complicated.", "created_at": "2016-01-12T18:57:22Z", "repo": "arch-finder", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "53c837ba1b7d8f15f3d35ee2f83ecdf2c1ba8dcc", "message": "Create output directories for each given allele frequency", "created_at": "2016-01-12T18:33:07Z", "repo": "arch-finder", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "bfc4f7be88474a7b57a5576f98c80957a77548af", "message": "Clean up and reorganize the Makefile", "created_at": "2016-01-12T16:27:35Z", "repo": "arch-finder", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2e9e9a2432eb01c81b79ffff6e3333db6ff2d0e5", "message": "Create VCF for each set of sites (Nea/Den/both)", "created_at": "2016-01-12T14:46:58Z", "repo": "arch-finder", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "87e089aeec282818ee029c8ab3b48a8663f84e01", "message": "Remove final filtering on biallelic sites in VCF\n\nAgain, not immediately useful for analysis of 1000 Genomes Project data,\nwhich contains only biallelic sites anyway, but it will become necessary\nwhen/if we decide to analyze the high-coverage SGDP panel data.", "created_at": "2016-01-11T12:30:42Z", "repo": "arch-finder", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "42015ddfb584d0412497c92b96cf96d306d2ac43", "message": "Include sites where archaics are heterozygous", "created_at": "2016-01-09T17:52:04Z", "repo": "arch-finder", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "206918f50fbb8278bb6501b19b2c5fc70265dea5", "message": "Fix incorrectly specified make variable", "created_at": "2016-01-09T16:24:09Z", "repo": "arch-finder", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b300fd3b26b78d276047b44cc5fa4135065e6268", "message": "Specify allowed archaic allele frequency in Africa", "created_at": "2016-01-08T20:16:19Z", "repo": "arch-finder", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3fe6b942ad574b5eefce665a3812082d9bc9ac3d", "message": "Remove unnecessary logging info", "created_at": "2016-01-08T19:12:37Z", "repo": "arch-finder", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6b5a7413e92c04448f0b35fc6462e4ffd6c7de0a", "message": "Fix error in the frequency calculation", "created_at": "2016-01-08T19:04:25Z", "repo": "arch-finder", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "8c98d2f4c272e0903ddf43f4874dec4cc3892d08", "message": "Add conditioning on given AFR major allele frequency", "created_at": "2016-01-08T13:51:11Z", "repo": "arch-finder", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "861796e7ebe35b326219b5a41881372cad9c0c9e", "message": "Remove conditioning on polymorphic SNPs in non-Africans\n\nWhile not immediately useful for analyses of 1000 genomes data (which\ncontain only polymorphic sites) it will be useful for analyses of\nhigh-coverage C-team dataset which has information about all\npositions in the genome.", "created_at": "2016-01-07T18:32:52Z", "repo": "arch-finder", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "56f213eaad8a7d3b3048d9a71a88efb4fd9cb9c7", "message": "Refactor the code for filtering triallelic sites", "created_at": "2016-01-07T17:30:37Z", "repo": "arch-finder", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "bab6b08fc8a00cf14821559b79567b9535cce18f", "message": "Ignore sites where Altai, Denisovan and Africans all differ\n\nThis was possible to happen since both Altai and Denisovan were compared\nwith Africans independently and since in the final BED table only\none archaic allele can be present, these triallelic sites cause\nproblems.", "created_at": "2016-01-07T17:25:39Z", "repo": "arch-finder", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "eaa646e15b934e54c18a9f3dc9d10d4be94f2f79", "message": "Update the .gitignore file", "created_at": "2015-12-21T21:52:34Z", "repo": "arch-finder", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "bc84519629b10356af4a4049653a5221d260548a", "message": "Update the README.md file", "created_at": "2015-12-21T21:47:47Z", "repo": "arch-finder", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6f7f247752ccc95fb5b006e27552c999fff056d0", "message": "Add README.md file", "created_at": "2015-12-21T21:38:09Z", "repo": "arch-finder", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5e63319548f45f5ca2ed8da98f95dc22f3b29364", "message": "Initial commit", "created_at": "2015-12-21T21:22:51Z", "repo": "arch-finder", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "13759d2d97ce1434b12418ad2395ca98fc170016", "message": "Merge pull request #5 from bodkan/licenses\n\nAdd license information", "created_at": "2020-07-13T10:30:56Z", "repo": "archaic-ychr", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "50544a27350f0df772a7b907c616e6dad6cf5863", "message": "Update README.org", "created_at": "2020-07-13T10:30:01Z", "repo": "archaic-ychr", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ec3e5157937255bbbbb3c2784ccf5fd329775922", "message": "Add license information", "created_at": "2020-07-13T10:28:49Z", "repo": "archaic-ychr", "file_sampled": false, "has_